    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31609" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκᾰτέρ-ωθεν</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>on each side, on either hand,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.102
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.75
			</span></i> : c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑ. τῆς πόλεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.6
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἑ. μέρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phd.</u>
					112e
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>at each end,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gp.
				5.27.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>on both sides, by father and mother,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				8.85
			</span></i>.</div>
